UObjectToolTips.FortRangedWeaponStats:RecoilBounceFactor:
0-1. How much recoil also gets added to a "bounce" layer that affects aesthetics but not firing accuracy:
This layer is applied BETWEEN shots, so by the time the next shot is ready the previous shot's "bounce" is used up;
This layer can affect the reticle and camera differently (RecoilBounceOffsetFactor);
This layer isn't countered/used-up by the player's camera input, so it's a good way to retain "bouncy" looking recoil when regular recoil and recoil recovery are balancing out.

