UObjectToolTips.QuestItemComponentDebugDrawData:
FQuestItemComponentDebugDrawData
Struct used by quest item components to pass an instruction to the ImGui Quest Debugger for display purposes.
This instruction is a EQuestItemComponentDebugStyleType that can be paired with an FString specifying what / how something should be drawn on the debugger.
These instructions are wrapped in FQuestItemComponentDebuggerDisplayData for a component to store all instructions that should be included together.
Example Instruction: Draw the text "This is a sample message: " in white, followed by "Hello World!" in green on the same line

FQuestItemComponentDebuggerDisplayData DisplayData;
DisplayData.DrawData.Add(FQuestItemComponentDebugDrawData(EQuestItemComponentDebugStyleType::PushStyleColor, QuestItemComponentDebugStrings::Color_White));
DisplayData.DrawData.Add(FQuestItemComponentDebugDrawData(EQuestItemComponentDebugStyleType::NewLineText, TEXT("This is a sample message: ")));
DisplayData.DrawData.Add(FQuestItemComponentDebugDrawData(EQuestItemComponentDebugStyleType::PopStyleColor));

DisplayData.DrawData.Add(FQuestItemComponentDebugDrawData(EQuestItemComponentDebugStyleType::PushStyleColor, QuestItemComponentDebugStrings::Color_Green));
DisplayData.DrawData.Add(FQuestItemComponentDebugDrawData(EQuestItemComponentDebugStyleType::SameLineText, TEXT("Hello World!")));
DisplayData.DrawData.Add(FQuestItemComponentDebugDrawData(EQuestItemComponentDebugStyleType::PopStyleColor));

